(4797, 44, 4, 111, 'French', 111, 1037, 4200, NULL, NULL, 8, NULL, 'French: Listening and speaking - Interactive Speaking', 'Listening and speaking', 1, 'Listening and speaking', 'Interactive Speaking', 'respond to questions and prompts to show comprehension and engagement\nuse vocabulary and expressions appropriately to probe and engage in oral interactions\nuse non-verbal communication cues to enhance communication\nexhibit confidence to contribute actively in conversations', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'draft', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-01 00:02:52', '2026-08-01 00:02:52'),
