(4925, 44, 4, 104, 'Religious Education', 104, 1006, 4088, NULL, NULL, 8, NULL, 'Religious Education: Christian Living - Leisure (CRE)', 'Christian Living', 16, 'Christian Living', 'Leisure', 'outline different ways of spending leisure time\nanalyse how youths misuse leisure today\nevaluate five effects of alcohol, drug and substance abuse on an individual\nestablish moral values and life skills needed to avoid alcohol, drug and substance abuse\nread the scriptures provided and itemize lessons learnt\nutilise Christian moral values to avoid alcohol, drug and substance abuse', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'draft', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-01 00:02:52', '2026-08-01 00:02:52'),
(4926, 44, 4, 104, 'Religious Education', 104, 1007, 4089, NULL, NULL, 8, NULL, 'Religious Education: Qur’an - Ulum al- Qur’an (IRE)', 'Qur’an', 17, 'Qur’an', 'Ulum al- Qur’an', 'describe the miraculous nature of the Qur’an to strengthen iman\nexplain the language of the Qur’an for better understanding\nidentify different styles of the Qur’an for better understanding\nappreciate the miraculous nature of the Qur’an as a divine scripture', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'draft', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-01 00:02:52', '2026-08-01 00:02:52'),
(4927, 44, 4, 104, 'Religious Education', 104, 1007, 4090, NULL, NULL, 8, NULL, 'Religious Education: Qur’an - Selected Chapter Surah al- Hujurat (Q 49) (IRE)', 'Qur’an', 18, 'Qur’an', 'Selected Chapter Surah al- Hujurat (Q 49)', 'read Surah al-Hujurat (Q 49) correctly for spiritual nourishment\nexplain the meaning of the verses of Surah al-Hujurat for better understanding\ndeduce lessons from Surah al- Hujurat for application in daily life\napply the teachings of Surah al- Hujurat in their daily life\ntreasure the teachings from Surah al-Hujurat as a guide in relationships', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'draft', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-01 00:02:52', '2026-08-01 00:02:52'),
(4928, 44, 4, 104, 'Religious Education', 104, 1008, 4091, NULL, NULL, 8, NULL, 'Religious Education: Hadith - Ulum al-Hadith (IRE)', 'Hadith', 19, 'Hadith', 'Ulum al-Hadith', 'identify the six authentic Books of Hadith as a source of guidance\ndescribe the characteristics of different classes of Hadith (sahih, hasan, and dhaif) to differentiate between authentic and unauthentic Hadith\nexplain reasons for the classification of Hadith for authenticity\nexamine factors that necessitated the collection and compilation of Hadith during the period of Tabi\'in and Tabi’i -Tabi’in as a measure of preservation\ndescribe the process of collection and compilation of Hadith during the period of the Tabi\'in\nappreciate the collection and compilation of Hadith as a source of Islamic sharia. Tabi’in and present on charts/PowerPoint', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'draft', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-01 00:02:52', '2026-08-01 00:02:52'),
(4929, 44, 4, 104, 'Religious Education', 104, 1008, 4092, NULL, NULL, 8, NULL, 'Religious Education: Hadith - Selected Hadith (IRE)', 'Hadith', 20, 'Hadith', 'Selected Hadith', 'deduce lessons from the Hadith on unity and avoidance of ill motives among Muslims\nexplain the relevance of the Hadith on unity and avoidance of ill motives in the life of a Muslim\npractise the teachings from the Hadith on unity and avoidance of ill motives in daily life\nhonour Hadith as the second source of law and spiritual guidance', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'draft', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-01 00:02:52', '2026-08-01 00:02:52'),
(4930, 44, 4, 104, 'Religious Education', 104, 1009, 4093, NULL, NULL, 8, NULL, 'Religious Education: Pillars of Iman - Belief in the Last Day (Day of Judgement) (IRE)', 'Pillars of Iman', 21, 'Pillars of Iman', 'Belief in the Last Day (Day of Judgement)', 'describe the events of the Last Day for accountability\nassess the significance of believing in the Last Day for spiritual nourishment\nexercise righteousness in preparation for the Last Day\ndesire to lead a righteous life to earn Allah (S.W.T.)’s blessings', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'draft', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-01 00:02:52', '2026-08-01 00:02:52'),
(4931, 44, 4, 104, 'Religious Education', 104, 1009, 4094, NULL, NULL, 8, NULL, 'Religious Education: Pillars of Iman - Belief in Qadar (IRE)', 'Pillars of Iman', 22, 'Pillars of Iman', 'Belief in Qadar', 'describe the effects of believing in Qadar and Qadha as a pillar of Iman\nassess the significance of believing in Qadar and Qadha for spiritual nourishment\nappreciate belief in Qadar and Qadha to accept the Will of Allah', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'draft', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-01 00:02:52', '2026-08-01 00:02:52'),
(4932, 44, 4, 104, 'Religious Education', 104, 1010, 4095, NULL, NULL, 8, NULL, 'Religious Education: Devotional Acts - Shariah (Islamic law) (IRE)', 'Devotional Acts', 23, 'Devotional Acts', 'Shariah (Islamic law)', 'explain the purpose of Islamic Shariah (Maqasid al-Shariah) as a guide for Muslims\nassess the relevance of Islamic Shariah in the contemporary world\ndescribe the categories of legal acts in Islamic Shariah as a means of upholding divine guidance\napply Islamic Shariah in day-to-day life\nacknowledge Shariah as a source of divine guidance', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'draft', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-01 00:02:52', '2026-08-01 00:02:52'),
(4933, 44, 4, 104, 'Religious Education', 104, 1010, 4096, NULL, NULL, 8, NULL, 'Religious Education: Devotional Acts - Tawbah (Repentance) (IRE)', 'Devotional Acts', 24, 'Devotional Acts', 'Tawbah (Repentance)', 'state the conditions of tawbah as a basis for forgiveness from Allah (S.W.T.)\nassess the significance of tawbah in the life of a Muslim\npractise actions that lead to tawbah as a way of purifying one from sins\nappreciate the virtue of tawbah as a condition for success in this life and the Hereafter', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'draft', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-01 00:02:52', '2026-08-01 00:02:52'),
(4934, 44, 4, 104, 'Religious Education', 104, 1011, 4097, NULL, NULL, 8, NULL, 'Religious Education: Akhlaq (Moral Teachings) - Virtues in Islam (IRE)', 'Akhlaq (Moral Teachings)', 25, 'Akhlaq (Moral Teachings)', 'Virtues in Islam', 'explain Islamic teachings on observing modesty, contentment, and trustworthiness in fulfilment of Allah (S.W.T.)’s commandments\ndescribe ways in which Muslims can practise modesty, contentment, and trustworthiness as part of faith\nassess the significance of observing modesty, contentment and trustworthiness in upholding Islamic morality in society\npractise modesty, contentment, and trustworthiness in day-to-day life to earn rewards from Allah (S.W.T.)\nvalue modesty, contentment, and trustworthiness for a morally upright society', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'draft', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-01 00:02:52', '2026-08-01 00:02:52'),
(4935, 44, 4, 104, 'Religious Education', 104, 1011, 4098, NULL, NULL, 8, NULL, 'Religious Education: Akhlaq (Moral Teachings) - Significance of Islamic Morality (IRE)', 'Akhlaq (Moral Teachings)', 26, 'Akhlaq (Moral Teachings)', 'Significance of Islamic Morality', 'assess the significance of Islamic morality in promoting righteousness\npractise Islamic morality to earn Allah’s rewards\nuphold Islamic morality as a way of promoting an upright society', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'draft', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-01 00:02:52', '2026-08-01 00:02:52'),
(4936, 44, 4, 104, 'Religious Education', 104, 1011, 4099, NULL, NULL, 8, NULL, 'Religious Education: Akhlaq (Moral Teachings) - Prohibitions in Islam Zina (fornication and adultery) (IRE)', 'Akhlaq (Moral Teachings)', 27, 'Akhlaq (Moral Teachings)', 'Prohibitions in Islam Zina (fornication and adultery)', 'describe the effects of Zina on the community\njustify the reasons behind the prohibition of Zina for a morally upright society\nexplain the Islamic measures of curbing Zina for a morally upright society\nappreciate the prohibition of Zina for a healthy society', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'draft', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-01 00:02:52', '2026-08-01 00:02:52'),
(4937, 44, 4, 104, 'Religious Education', 104, 1012, 4100, NULL, NULL, 8, NULL, 'Religious Education: Muamalat (Social Relations) - Domestic violence (IRE)', 'Muamalat (Social Relations)', 28, 'Muamalat (Social Relations)', 'Domestic violence', 'explain the causes of domestic violence to settle family conflicts\nexplain the effects of domestic violence on the family\ndescribe measures to curb domestic violence in the family\nembrace measures proposed by Islam to curb domestic violence', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'draft', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-01 00:02:52', '2026-08-01 00:02:52'),
(4938, 44, 4, 104, 'Religious Education', 104, 1012, 4101, NULL, NULL, 8, NULL, 'Religious Education: Muamalat (Social Relations) - Iddah (IRE)', 'Muamalat (Social Relations)', 29, 'Muamalat (Social Relations)', 'Iddah', 'describe the iddah for a divorcee and a widow in Islam to foster obedience to divine guidance\nexplain the rationale for observing iddah as an act of ibadah\nstate the rules of iddah as a means of safeguarding its validity\nassess the importance of iddah to the divorced and widowed Muslim woman\nappreciate iddah as an act of ibadah', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'draft', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-01 00:02:52', '2026-08-01 00:02:52'),
(4939, 44, 4, 104, 'Religious Education', 104, 1012, 4102, NULL, NULL, 8, NULL, 'Religious Education: Muamalat (Social Relations) - Child custody (IRE)', 'Muamalat (Social Relations)', 30, 'Muamalat (Social Relations)', 'Child custody', 'identify the Islamic rules on child custody to safeguard the child’s rights\nassess the significance of Islamic rules on child custody\nappreciate Islamic teachings on child custody as a means of fostering family bonds', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'draft', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-01 00:02:52', '2026-08-01 00:02:52'),
(4940, 44, 4, 104, 'Religious Education', 104, 1012, 4103, NULL, NULL, 8, NULL, 'Religious Education: Muamalat (Social Relations) - Polygamy in Islam (IRE)', 'Muamalat (Social Relations)', 31, 'Muamalat (Social Relations)', 'Polygamy in Islam', 'explain the reasons for polygamy in Islam for social stability\njustify the reasons for the Prophet’s multiple marriages\nstate the conditions for polygamy in Islam\nassess the significance of polygamy in Islam\nappreciate the Islamic concept of polygamy as a social remedy to safeguard human dignity', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'draft', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-01 00:02:52', '2026-08-01 00:02:52'),
(4941, 44, 4, 104, 'Religious Education', 104, 1012, 4104, NULL, NULL, 8, NULL, 'Religious Education: Muamalat (Social Relations) - Trade and Finance in Islam (IRE)', 'Muamalat (Social Relations)', 32, 'Muamalat (Social Relations)', 'Trade and Finance in Islam', 'explain the Islamic rules on borrowing and lending money\npractise Islamic teachings on borrowing and lending money to earn rewards from Allah (S.W.T.)\ndescribe the role of consumer protection agencies in enhancing integrity\nappreciate the Islamic concept of borrowing and lending money as a means of safeguarding equity in society', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'draft', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-01 00:02:52', '2026-08-01 00:02:52');
