(5379, 44, 8, 91, 'English', 91, 749, 2807, NULL, NULL, 8, NULL, 'English: Grammar in Use - Word Classes', 'Grammar in Use', 14, 'Grammar in Use', 'Word Classes', 'identify personal and possessive pronouns used as subjects and objects for communication, b ) use personal and possessive pronouns as subject and object correctly for self- expression\nadopt the use of personal and possessive pronouns in communication\nform appropriate contracted forms of verbs in varied texts\nuse positive and negative statements in sentences\nrealise the importance of correct sentence structures in communication', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'draft', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-01 00:02:55', '2026-08-01 00:02:55'),
