(5503, 44, 8, 94, 'Religious Education', 94, 771, 2911, NULL, NULL, 8, NULL, 'Religious Education: Akhlaq (Moral Teachings) - Islamic Manners of Dressing (IRE)', 'Akhlaq (Moral Teachings)', 43, 'Akhlaq (Moral Teachings)', 'Islamic Manners of Dressing', 'describe appropriate Islamic code of dressing as per the teachings of Islam\nassess the significance of Islamic code of dressing to enhance character formation\nobserve Islamic manners of dressing as an act of ibadah\nappreciate Islamic code of dressing as a means of earning rewards from Allah', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'draft', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-01 00:02:55', '2026-08-01 00:02:55'),
