(5666, 44, 9, 93, 'Mathematics', 93, 817, 3154, NULL, NULL, 8, NULL, 'Mathematics: Numbers - Whole Numbers', 'Numbers', 1, 'Numbers', 'Whole Numbers', 'use place value and total value of digits up to hundreds of thousands in different situations\nread and write numbers up to tens of thousands in words in different situations\norder numbers up to tens of thousands in different situations\nround off numbers up to tens of thousands to the nearest hundred and thousand in different situations\napply divisibility tests of 2, 5 and 10 in real-life situations\ndetermine Highest Common Factor (HCF) and Greatest Common Divisor (GCD) in different situations\ndetermine Least Common Multiple (LCM) in real-life situations\nappreciate use of whole numbers in real-life situations. • carry out the divisibility test for 2, 5 and 10 and come up with divisibility rules, • express numbers in terms of their factors then identify the common factors, • express the multiples of numbers and identify multiples of the common multiples as well as the least common multiples, • play games involving numbers using digital devices or other resources', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'draft', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-01 00:02:56', '2026-08-01 00:02:56');
