(6202, 44, 11, 107, 'Pre-Technical Studies', 107, 975, 3888, NULL, NULL, 8, NULL, 'Pre-Technical Studies: Entrepreneurship - Bookkeeping', 'Entrepreneurship', 10, 'Entrepreneurship', 'Bookkeeping', 'explain the importance of bookkeeping in entrepreneurship\nclassify business transactions in bookkeeping\nprepare simple financial statements for a business\nappreciate the importance of financial records in day-to-day life', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'draft', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-01 00:02:59', '2026-08-01 00:02:59'),
(6203, 44, 11, 107, 'Pre-Technical Studies', 107, 975, 3889, NULL, NULL, 8, NULL, 'Pre-Technical Studies: Entrepreneurship - Income and Budgeting', 'Entrepreneurship', 11, 'Entrepreneurship', 'Income and Budgeting', 'identify sources of income for an individual\nexplain the importance of budgeting in day-to-day life\nprepare a simple budget for personal financial management\nexplore ethical and unethical practices in budgeting\nappreciate the importance of financial planning in income management', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'draft', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-01 00:02:59', '2026-08-01 00:02:59'),
(6204, 44, 11, 107, 'Pre-Technical Studies', 107, 975, 3890, NULL, NULL, 8, NULL, 'Pre-Technical Studies: Entrepreneurship - Marketing of Goods and Services', 'Entrepreneurship', 12, 'Entrepreneurship', 'Marketing of Goods and Services', 'explain the importance of marketing to a business\nanalyse the sources of information about the market for its potential customers\nexplore factors considered when selecting a suitable market for goods and services\nselect tools to market goods and services\nrecognise suitable markets for goods and services', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'draft', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-01 00:02:59', '2026-08-01 00:02:59'),
(6205, 44, 11, 107, 'Pre-Technical Studies', 107, 975, 3891, NULL, NULL, 8, NULL, 'Pre-Technical Studies: Entrepreneurship - Distribution of Goods and Services', 'Entrepreneurship', 13, 'Entrepreneurship', 'Distribution of Goods and Services', 'explain the role of intermediaries in the distribution of goods and services\nillustrate the channels for distributing different goods and services in business\nanalyse ethics in distribution of goods and services\nvalue the need for distribution of goods and services in the community', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'draft', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-01 00:02:59', '2026-08-01 00:02:59'),
(6206, 44, 11, 104, 'Religious Education', 104, 957, 3839, NULL, NULL, 8, NULL, 'Religious Education: Creation - Origin and Consequences of Sin (CRE)', 'Creation', 1, 'Creation', 'Origin and Consequences of Sin', 'explain the origin of sin from the scriptures provided\nexamine the consequences of sin after the fall of man\nanalyse the causes of sin today\nidentify moral values and life skills needed to overcome temptations\npray to God to overcome temptations in day-to-day life', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'draft', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-01 00:02:59', '2026-08-01 00:02:59'),
(6207, 44, 11, 104, 'Religious Education', 104, 957, 3840, NULL, NULL, 8, NULL, 'Religious Education: Creation - God’s Plan for Redemption (CRE)', 'Creation', 2, 'Creation', 'God’s Plan for Redemption', 'describe how God demonstrated love to humankind after the fall of man\nexamine how God’s plan of salvation is fulfilled through Jesus Christ\nexplain the importance of redemption after the fall of man\ntake part in sharing the love of God with others\nappreciate God’s saving grace in their day -to-day life', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'draft', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-01 00:02:59', '2026-08-01 00:02:59'),
(6208, 44, 11, 104, 'Religious Education', 104, 958, 3841, NULL, NULL, 8, NULL, 'Religious Education: The Bible - Faith and God’s Promises (CRE)', 'The Bible', 3, 'The Bible', 'Faith and God’s Promises', 'describe the background to the call of Abraham\nexamine ways Abraham demonstrated faith in God\napply faith in different situations as exemplified by Abraham\nelaborate the promises made by God to Abraham\nexplain the importance of God’s promises to Christians today\napply God’s promises in their daily lives', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'draft', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-01 00:02:59', '2026-08-01 00:02:59'),
(6209, 44, 11, 104, 'Religious Education', 104, 958, 3842, NULL, NULL, 8, NULL, 'Religious Education: The Bible - Abrahamic Covenant (CRE)', 'The Bible', 4, 'The Bible', 'Abrahamic Covenant', 'identify covenants in modern life and their importance\nelaborate the covenant made by God to Abraham\nexplain the importance of God’s covenant with Abraham\noutline the importance of circumcision to Abraham and his descendants\nevaluate characteristics of ungodly covenants today\nestablish how to discern ungodly covenants as guided by the word of God\ndesire to trust in God at all times. • read James 4:7, Mathew 4: 8-10, 1Peter 5:8-9, Mathew 7:15-20 and discuss how to resist or discern ungodly covenants, • buzz on how to apply faith in difficult situations and make summary notes', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'draft', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-01 00:02:59', '2026-08-01 00:02:59'),
(6210, 44, 11, 104, 'Religious Education', 104, 958, 3843, NULL, NULL, 8, NULL, 'Religious Education: The Bible - Leadership in Israel: Saul (CRE)', 'The Bible', 5, 'The Bible', 'Leadership in Israel: Saul', 'discuss reasons for kingship in Israel\nexamine reasons against kingship in Israel\nevaluate King Saul’s failures and the consequences\ndeduce lessons learnt from the failures of King Saul\ndesire to be a God-fearing leader at school and in church', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'draft', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-01 00:02:59', '2026-08-01 00:02:59'),
(6211, 44, 11, 104, 'Religious Education', 104, 959, 3844, NULL, NULL, 8, NULL, 'Religious Education: Miracles of Jesus Christ - Calming the Storm (CRE)', 'Miracles of Jesus Christ', 6, 'Miracles of Jesus Christ', 'Calming the Storm', 'describe the miracle of calming the storm\noutline lessons learnt from the miracle of calming the storm\nidentify the challenges they face in daily life\napply lessons learnt to overcome the challenges they face as youths\ndesire to depend on God when faced with challenges', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'draft', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-01 00:02:59', '2026-08-01 00:02:59'),
(6212, 44, 11, 104, 'Religious Education', 104, 959, 3845, NULL, NULL, 8, NULL, 'Religious Education: Miracles of Jesus Christ - Healing of the Paralytic (CRE)', 'Miracles of Jesus Christ', 7, 'Miracles of Jesus Christ', 'Healing of the Paralytic', 'describe the healing of the paralytic\noutline lessons learnt from the healing of the paralytic\nexamine the Pharisees’ opposition to the healing of the paralytic\napply lessons learnt from the miracle in daily life\nappreciate God’s power over sickness and disease', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'draft', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-01 00:02:59', '2026-08-01 00:02:59'),
(6213, 44, 11, 104, 'Religious Education', 104, 960, 3846, NULL, NULL, 8, NULL, 'Religious Education: Teachings of Jesus Christ - Teachings on Prayer (CRE)', 'Teachings of Jesus Christ', 8, 'Teachings of Jesus Christ', 'Teachings on Prayer', 'outline the importance of prayer in the life of a Christian\ndiscuss the importance of having faith when they pray to God\ndemonstrate love by praying for all people\napply lessons learnt by praying persistently\nexercise faith whenever they pray to God', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'draft', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-01 00:02:59', '2026-08-01 00:02:59'),
(6214, 44, 11, 104, 'Religious Education', 104, 960, 3847, NULL, NULL, 8, NULL, 'Religious Education: Teachings of Jesus Christ - The Lost Sheep (CRE)', 'Teachings of Jesus Christ', 9, 'Teachings of Jesus Christ', 'The Lost Sheep', 'describe the parable of the lost sheep\ntake part in reaching out to the lost through evangelism\nexemplify God’s love by serving all people', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'draft', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-01 00:02:59', '2026-08-01 00:02:59'),
(6215, 44, 11, 104, 'Religious Education', 104, 961, 3848, NULL, NULL, 8, NULL, 'Religious Education: The Church - The Holy Spirit (CRE)', 'The Church', 10, 'The Church', 'The Holy Spirit', 'describe the outpouring of the Holy Spirit on the day of Pentecost\nanalyse ways Christians exemplify the fruit of the Holy Spirit\ntake part in church activities to foster responsibility\nexplain the importance of participating in Church activities\ndesire to be guided by the Holy Spirit in daily life', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'draft', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-01 00:02:59', '2026-08-01 00:02:59'),
(6216, 44, 11, 104, 'Religious Education', 104, 961, 3849, NULL, NULL, 8, NULL, 'Religious Education: The Church - Acts of Compassion (CRE)', 'The Church', 11, 'The Church', 'Acts of Compassion', 'describe the role of the church in helping the needy\nlist the needy/those who should be helped; Leviticus 19:32-33 & Psalms 82:3\nrelate acts of compassion itemised in Matthew 25:31-40\nestablish those who will inherit the kingdom of God; Matthew 25:34-40\ndistinguish unrighteous acts specified in Matthew 25:41-46\ntake part in a community service activity in the school neighbourhood\ndesire to participate in acts of charity. • write, Matthew 25:40 on a flash card and meditate on it, • who are the unrighteous according to Matthew 25:41-46, • role play Mathew 25:31-46, • as a class, organise a visit to the less fortunate, write a detailed report of your visitation, activities done, and lessons learnt and present it in hard copy or PowerPoint slides, • list acts of charity they will participate in as individuals or as a group, • compose a poem on helping the needy/ destitute', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'draft', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-01 00:02:59', '2026-08-01 00:02:59'),
(6217, 44, 11, 104, 'Religious Education', 104, 962, 3850, NULL, NULL, 8, NULL, 'Religious Education: Christian Living Today - Family Relationships (CRE)', 'Christian Living Today', 12, 'Christian Living Today', 'Family Relationships', 'outline roles played by different family members\nidentify practices which depict healthy family relationships\noutline causes of conflicts in families today\npropose solutions to conflicts facing families today\ndescribe ways children should relate to their parents\nlist five values needed to live harmoniously with family members\nutilize the values listed in their interaction with family members. • journal how they apply the values listed to ensure family unity, • share the journal with their parents or guardians', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'draft', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-01 00:02:59', '2026-08-01 00:02:59'),
(6218, 44, 11, 104, 'Religious Education', 104, 962, 3851, NULL, NULL, 8, NULL, 'Religious Education: Christian Living Today - Human Sexuality: Responsible Sexual Behaviour (CRE)', 'Christian Living Today', 13, 'Christian Living Today', 'Human Sexuality: Responsible Sexual Behaviour', 'identify forms of sexual abuse and how to avoid or overcome abuse\nevaluate causes of teenage pregnancies today\nexamine the consequences of engaging in irresponsible sexual behaviour\ndiscuss values and life skills needed to avoid irresponsible sexual behaviour\nchoose to live responsibly as guided by the word of God\nrespect their bodies by living a morally upright life', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'draft', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-01 00:02:59', '2026-08-01 00:02:59'),
(6219, 44, 11, 104, 'Religious Education', 104, 962, 3852, NULL, NULL, 8, NULL, 'Religious Education: Christian Living Today - Sacredness of life (CRE)', 'Christian Living Today', 14, 'Christian Living Today', 'Sacredness of life', 'explain the meaning of sacredness of life\nelaborate sacredness of life from the scriptures provided\ndiscuss how the right to life is violated today\nevaluate causes of suicide in today’s society\nexamine causes of abortion among teenage girls\nanalyse the consequences of violating the right to life\ncompile values and life skills needed to uphold sacredness of life', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'draft', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-01 00:02:59', '2026-08-01 00:02:59'),
(6220, 44, 11, 104, 'Religious Education', 104, 962, 3853, NULL, NULL, 8, NULL, 'Religious Education: Christian Living Today - Bullying (CRE)', 'Christian Living Today', 15, 'Christian Living Today', 'Bullying', 'identify causes of bullying at school and in the community\nanalyse the effects of bullying on an individual and the family\noutline values needed to co-exist peacefully from the scriptures provided\nmodel the value of love in their interaction with others', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'draft', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-01 00:02:59', '2026-08-01 00:02:59'),
(6221, 44, 11, 104, 'Religious Education', 104, 962, 3854, NULL, NULL, 8, NULL, 'Religious Education: Christian Living Today - Work Talents, Gifts and Abilities (CRE)', 'Christian Living Today', 16, 'Christian Living Today', 'Work Talents, Gifts and Abilities', 'identify their God-given talents, gifts and abilities\ntake part in different activities to nurture their talents\ndescribe the parable of the talents in Matthew 25:14-30\ndiscuss lessons learnt from the parable of the talents\napply lessons learnt from the parable of talents in daily life\noriginate an income- generating enterprise to enhance financial literacy skills\ndemonstrate accountability by saving money from the enterprise', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'draft', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-01 00:02:59', '2026-08-01 00:02:59');
