(6481, 44, 13, 116, 'Religious Education', 116, 1105, 4449, NULL, NULL, 8, NULL, 'Religious Education: Scriptures - Names of other Scriptures (HRE)', 'Scriptures', 31, 'Scriptures', 'Names of other Scriptures', 'mention scriptures from other faiths for familiarisation\nmatch the scripture with their respective religion for enhancing knowledge\nacknowledge the importance of Scriptures to promote religious tolerance\nstate the importance of scriptures in their day to day lives\nmention at least three values learnt from scriptures\nappreciate the scriptures as a guide to promote spiritual growth', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'draft', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-01 00:03:00', '2026-08-01 00:03:00'),
(6482, 44, 13, 116, 'Religious Education', 116, 1105, 4450, NULL, NULL, 8, NULL, 'Religious Education: Scriptures - Role of Scriptures (HRE)', 'Scriptures', 32, 'Scriptures', 'Role of Scriptures', 'state the importance of scriptures in their day to day lives\nmention at least three values learnt from scriptures\nappreciate the scriptures as a guide to promote spiritual growth', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'draft', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-01 00:03:00', '2026-08-01 00:03:00'),
(6483, 44, 13, 116, 'Religious Education', 116, 1106, 4451, NULL, NULL, 8, NULL, 'Religious Education: Worship - Protocols of Worship (HRE)', 'Worship', 33, 'Worship', 'Protocols of Worship', 'identify the protocols of worship for each faith\ndemonstrate the protocols of worship for respect to Paramatma\nappreciate protocols of worship outside /inside a place of worship\nrecite the seven selected basic chants/Dhuns of each faith\ndemonstrate the appropriate order for the recitation of basic chants/Dhuns to show respect to Paramatma\nappreciate recitation of Chants/Dhuns as an act of worship. the basic Chants/Dhuns, ● recite chants/Dhuns, ● visit places of worship accompanied by teachers/ parents to observe and participate in the chanting, ● perform basic chants/Dhun with the guidance of their teacher and parent. recite Chants/Dhuns? 275 Ϯϲϲ 4.3 Musical Instruments in Worship (6 lessons) ● Tabla ● Harmonium ● Manjira By the end of the sub- strand the learner should be able to:\nidentify different types of musical instruments used in worship in the four faiths\nplay musical instruments used in their place of worship\nappreciate the use of musical instruments in worship for spiritual growth', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'draft', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-01 00:03:00', '2026-08-01 00:03:00'),
