(6486, 44, 13, 116, 'Religious Education', 116, 1107, 4454, NULL, NULL, 8, NULL, 'Religious Education: Sadachaar - General Etiquettes (HRE)', 'Sadachaar', 36, 'Sadachaar', 'General Etiquettes', 'mention words that express general etiquette for a healthy relationship\ndemonstrate forms of greetings for different age of people\nappreciate different forms of greetings in our daily life\nidentify different practices of gratitude in their neighbourhood\ndemonstrate practice of gratitude at places of worship\npractice gratitude while observing measures of safety and security\nappreciate the practice of gratitude in daily life\ngive examples of selfless service to be carried out at home, school and at place of worship\npractice sharing\nappreciate sewa as a form of selfless service. and helping the needy members in the society, ● recite short poems on sharing and recite in the class, ● visit the centers for disabled children accompanied by parents/teachers to carry out age-appropriate selfless service activities', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'draft', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-01 00:03:00', '2026-08-01 00:03:00'),
