eading\nread sentences in a text accurately, at the right speed, and with expression for fluency\nrealise the role of fluency in reading\nidentify words with the target sounds /l/, / s/ and /r/ accurately', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'draft', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-01 00:03:01', '2026-08-01 00:03:01'),
